<title>HUNGARY: NYBB urges short-term 'no action' on TVK.</title>
<headline>NYBB urges short-term 'no action' on TVK.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian securities house New York Broker Budapest (NYBB) initiated technical coverage of chemicals firm TVK Rt with 'no action' for short term and 'buy' for the next six months.</p>
<p>&quot;The target price is 3,600 forints, after which may come a correction,&quot; analyst Balint Hada said in a report.</p>
<p>The target price for the next six months was between 3,600 forints and 4,600 forints, he said.</p>
<p>On Friday TVK shares finished at 3,540 forints, up 40.</p>
<p>-- Emese Bartha, Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
